+# SLA & Incident Management — Aegis
+
+1) SLOs & SLA
+- Define SLOs for availability, latency, and MTTR for critical services (FL controller, model serving, evidence pipeline).
+- Example: Canaries must rollback within 5 minutes (MTTR target).
+
+2) Incident lifecycle
+- Detection: Prometheus alert -> paged via PagerDuty adapter.
+- Triage: Infra & Product approvers assigned via approver roster.
+- Containment: Runbook tasks (isolate canary, scale down, revoke key).
+- Recovery: execute guarded KMS/rotation scripts if needed, restore last good model.
+- Postmortem: create GitHub issue with full evidence + Rekor UUIDs.
+
+3) Integrations
+- PagerDuty: ops/monitoring/pagerduty_alert_adapter.py
+- Audit ingestion: .github/workflows/audit_ingest_and_close.yml
